beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.b72769bf90d2aafc35742b0d3b95268b9e8f4b7b1f248722e5c32d83e27afaed\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.27fdfe7033ff3d7e0611516aa9bc01bf01d8e44045746801534f3ea9677daa47\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_5\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"售票员把窗口里的灯关掉时，雨正沿着站台的屋檐连成一条线。站台上的钟比手机慢了三分钟。林远核对了两次，没有走去询问值班员。他看见玻璃上自己的倒影，才发现他已经穿着这件外套站了很久。行李箱旁挂着新公司的地址，手机里存着一份还没签字的合同；这些东西都能说明他要去哪里，却没有一样能替他解释为什么迟迟不肯往前走。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_6\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":4,\"input\":null}],\"executionId\":\"player.a62d26c556cb29eda8a0c481\",\"inputTombstones\":[],\"irVersion\":\"1.2.0\",\"projectId\":\"project_a983033c0f7180355c93\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"0.6.0\",\"schemaVersion\":2},\"historyHash\":\"77d11ab27ae4621892a5cd1d5e0ceecc974f96a2b7aae89c70bfad6ca0a35cba\",\"irVersion\":\"1.2.0\",\"projectId\":\"project_a983033c0f7180355c93\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"0.6.0\",\"schemaVersion\":2}","checkpointStepId":null,"schemaVersion":3,"format":"world.player-save-slot","migratedFromSchemaVersion":null},"previewBase64":null,"origin":"current"},"sha256":"2c71a88ce69c5f7b3fa82669cf40498e3bcd65c86e09d6561d743752f2db23f8"}